    "summary": "A sample image entry: New York at another scale.",
    "html": "<h1 id=\"article-a-city-in-miniature\">A city in miniature</h1><p>A change in scale makes familiar streets, parks, and waterways visible all at once.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/pages/assets/city-model.jpg\" alt=\"A visitor standing before a large physical model of New York City.\" /></p>\n<p><em>Sample image entry.</em></p>\n",
